        {
          "text": "Kigirae ŋiletok a Naputali a ŋikalya kec iwuapitae ŋikalya atapapaa kec, kigirae ŋikilyok daadaŋ ŋulu arae ŋikaru kec ŋatomoniarei ka adepar, ŋulu apedorito alosit lojie, ",
