          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Ekapolon neni a Moses tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nyemaikina iyoŋ ikigir ŋilepi, kori kimar ikes kaapei ka Ŋisirael ŋuluce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai emaikina iyoŋ kiwuak ŋilepi akitere eema ŋolo ilipere ka ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu eya tooma keŋ. Ani apaki ŋina iwotokiniata iyes anakibois ka adio, ŋilepi ikes edakete eema ŋolo ilipere kaapei ka ŋiboro daadaŋ ŋulu eya tooma keŋ, emaikina ikes kiteto eema ŋol, ido toduko ŋiemae kec kirimokis eema ŋolo ilipere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iwuotokinete iyes anakibois a adio, ŋilepi ikes elacunete eema ŋol ka ikes pei edukokinete nabo nakibois ŋina ilomete iyes, ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini eapuuni loeema ŋol emaikina toarae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edukokinete Ŋisirael ŋuluce ŋiemae kec a ŋalomarisinei kec, ŋinituŋanan nalomar kec diyete abendera kec, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nai edukokinete ŋilepi ŋiemae kec diyete eema ŋolo eyai Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet irimokinito eema ŋol, ikotere nyeyakaun anyunyura ŋina ka Akuj natukot a Ŋisirael, ŋilepi make emaikina iyokiyete eema ŋol ŋolo eyai Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael kitiyata ŋun daadaŋ lopite ŋolo ecikitor Ekapolon Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.54"
            ]
          }
        }
